'''Liver Trouble''' (酒乱若人, ''Shuran Wakōdo'', '''Sake Young Man''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 2150.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

'''Pre-4.7''': "Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

